{"id":"tool_001","category":"tool_calling","prompt":"請查看目前工作區根目錄有哪些檔案與資料夾，並簡短回報。","expected_tools":["list_dir"],"tags":["tools","list_dir","workspace"]}
{"id":"tool_002","category":"tool_calling","prompt":"請找出目前工作區中所有副檔名為 .md 的檔案。","expected_tools":["glob"],"tags":["tools","glob","search"]}
{"id":"tool_003","category":"tool_calling","prompt":"請搜尋目前工作區中是否有出現字串 TODO，並回報結果。","expected_tools":["grep"],"tags":["tools","grep","search"]}
{"id":"tool_004","category":"tool_calling","prompt":"請建立一個名為 notes.txt 的檔案，內容是 hello picobot。","expected_tools":["write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"notes.txt","must_exist":true}],"tags":["tools","write_file","workspace"]}
{"id":"tool_005","category":"tool_calling","prompt":"請建立 docs/intro.md，內容包含標題 # Intro 與一句 This file is generated by picobot.","expected_tools":["write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"docs/intro.md","must_exist":true}],"tags":["tools","write_file","nested-file"]}
{"id":"tool_006","category":"tool_calling","prompt":"請讀取目前工作區中的 README.md，如果不存在就先說明你有檢查過。","expected_tools":["read_file"],"tags":["tools","read_file","workspace"]}
{"id":"tool_007","category":"tool_calling","prompt":"請執行一個簡單的 shell 指令顯示目前工作目錄，然後把結果回報給我。","expected_tools":["exec"],"tags":["tools","exec","shell"]}
{"id":"tool_008","category":"tool_calling","prompt":"請閱讀名稱為 tool-use-reminder 的 skill，並用一句話總結它的重點。","expected_tools":["read_skill"],"tags":["tools","read_skill","skills"]}
{"id":"workspace_001","category":"workspace","prompt":"請閱讀 README.md，並把重點整理成三行文字寫到 doc/summary.md。","setup_files":[{"path":"README.md","content":"# Demo Project\n\nThis project contains a chatbot runtime.\nIt supports tools and per-session workspace.\nUse FastAPI to expose APIs.\n"}],"expected_tools":["read_file","write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"doc/summary.md","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","read-write","summary"]}
{"id":"workspace_002","category":"workspace","prompt":"請把 config/app.json 中的 version 從 1 改成 2，其他內容不要動。","setup_files":[{"path":"config/app.json","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"demo-app\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"enabled\": true\n}\n"}],"expected_tools":["read_file","edit_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"config/app.json","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","edit_file","json"]}
{"id":"workspace_003","category":"workspace","prompt":"請讀取 src/message.txt，並建立 output/result.txt，內容是原文前面加上 Processed: 。","setup_files":[{"path":"src/message.txt","content":"hello world\n"}],"expected_tools":["read_file","write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"output/result.txt","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","transform","write_file"]}
{"id":"workspace_004","category":"workspace","prompt":"請搜尋專案中所有 TODO，並把找到的檔名列表寫到 report/todos.md。","setup_files":[{"path":"src/a.py","content":"# TODO: refactor this function\nprint('a')\n"},{"path":"src/b.py","content":"print('b')\n# TODO: add tests\n"}],"expected_tools":["grep","write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"report/todos.md","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","grep","report"]}
{"id":"workspace_005","category":"workspace","prompt":"請找出 data 目錄下所有 .txt 檔案，並把相對路徑整理到 docs/files.md。","setup_files":[{"path":"data/a.txt","content":"A\n"},{"path":"data/b.txt","content":"B\n"},{"path":"data/c.md","content":"ignore\n"}],"expected_tools":["glob","write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"docs/files.md","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","glob","report"]}
{"id":"workspace_006","category":"workspace","prompt":"請把 script.py 跑起來，然後把輸出結果寫到 output.txt。","setup_files":[{"path":"script.py","content":"print(3 * 7)\n"}],"expected_tools":["exec","write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"output.txt","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","exec","python"]}
{"id":"workspace_007","category":"workspace","prompt":"請讀取 notes/today.md，然後在同一個檔案最後面加上一行 DONE。","setup_files":[{"path":"notes/today.md","content":"Task A\nTask B\n"}],"expected_tools":["read_file","write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"notes/today.md","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","append","edit_file"]}
{"id":"workspace_008","category":"workspace","prompt":"請建立一份 docs/plan.md，內容包含三個 markdown 條列，主題是如何測試一個 agent。","expected_tools":["write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"docs/plan.md","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","markdown","write_file"]}
{"id":"workspace_009","category":"workspace","prompt":"請閱讀 src/app.py，並將其中字串 hello 改成 hello, picobot。","setup_files":[{"path":"src/app.py","content":"def main():\n    print('hello')\n"}],"expected_tools":["read_file","edit_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"src/app.py","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","code-edit","edit_file"]}
{"id":"workspace_010","category":"workspace","prompt":"請閱讀 doc/spec.md，然後產生 doc/checklist.md，列出三個 implementation checklist 項目。","setup_files":[{"path":"doc/spec.md","content":"# Spec\n\nFeature: upload files\nNeed auth check\nNeed file size limit\nNeed audit log\n"}],"expected_tools":["read_file","write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"doc/checklist.md","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","spec","checklist"]}
{"id":"workspace_011","category":"workspace","prompt":"請檢查目前資料夾結構，並建立 docs/tree.txt，簡單列出你看到的主要檔案或目錄。","setup_files":[{"path":"src/main.py","content":"print('main')\n"},{"path":"tests/test_main.py","content":"def test_main():\n    assert True\n"}],"expected_tools":["list_dir","write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"docs/tree.txt","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","list_dir","report"]}
{"id":"workspace_012","category":"workspace","prompt":"請讀取 data/input.txt，將內容轉成大寫後寫入 data/output.txt。","setup_files":[{"path":"data/input.txt","content":"hello picobot\n"}],"expected_tools":["read_file","write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"data/output.txt","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","transform","uppercase"]}
{"id":"workspace_013","category":"workspace","prompt":"請閱讀 README.md 和 CHANGELOG.md，然後在 docs/release_note.md 中寫一段 100 字內的版本摘要。","setup_files":[{"path":"README.md","content":"# App\nThis app supports chat, tools, and sessions.\n"},{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","content":"## v0.2.0\n- add streaming\n- add workspace APIs\n"}],"expected_tools":["read_file","write_file"],"expected_files":[{"path":"docs/release_note.md","must_exist":true}],"tags":["workspace","multi-file","summary"]}
